    751  f0b7							; --- Cave TIA restores inside the VBL window (moved 2026-10-06) ---
    752  f0b7							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    753  f0b7							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    754  f0b7							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    755  f0b7							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
    756  f0b7							; HUD cannot clobber these: HUD runs AFTER the kernel each frame.
