   1956  f518							; SelectActiveObject restored to bank0 (A1, 2026-10-20 — reverts C1). The
   1957  f518							; body + the two type tables sit in the $F615 fill (before CallPad_RaftBody's
   1958  f518							; $F8C0 pin) so nothing ahead of them moves address: bank0's flow tail is not
   1959  f518							; binding any more (680 B of org-able fill), and the move frees ~360 B in
   1960  f518							; bank2 for the bank3 evacuation. Entry is a plain in-bank `jsr` from the VBL;
