   2154  f5f4							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2155  f5f4							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2156  f5f4							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2157  f5f4							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2158  f5f4							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2159  f5f4							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2160  f5f4							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2161  f5f4							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2162  f5f4							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2163  f5f4							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2164  f5f4							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2165  f5f4				   CEH_Key
   2166  f5f4		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   2167  f5f6		       1d c9 f3 	      ora	EnemyBitTable,X
   2168  f5f9		       85 ba		      sta	EnemyDeadMask
