   2176  f606							; UEDispatch — the enemy-type dispatch tail, moved out of UpdateEnemies into the
   2177  f606							; $F82C pin gap (upstream of the $F8DD sprite pin, so the pre-pad END is
   2178  f606							; unaffected and the 15 B the folded chain frees stays free). Every non-raft arm
   2179  f606							; tail-jumps, exactly like the old inline chain, so the stack depth is unchanged.
   2180  f606							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
