   3071  f9c1							; PositionBallM1 — D6 asymmetric objects, BOTH positioned in one VBL call.
   3072  f9c1							; WHY here: pre-pad headroom is 1B — inline ball+m1 (22B) cannot live in the
   3073  f9c1							; VBL block, so the ball block became this jsr and the body sits in the
   3074  f9c1							; $F9C4..$FBF7 fill (ReturnPad pin at $FBF8 unaffected; F6-safe:
   3075  f9c1							; $F9C4 & $1FFF = $19C4 ∉ $1FF4-$1FF7; bank0-only, not a fold twin).
   3076  f9c1							;   Temp	   = staged BallX (bank2 StageBandTab): 0 = symmetric → skip.
   3077  f9c1							;		     selector 4 = HMBL/RESPBL, ball x drawn clocks [A-7,A].
