   3808  fca5							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   3809  fca5							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   3810  fca5							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit). Post-pad leaf (bank0 pre-pad
   3811  fca5							; is at its 1B limit); reached from CheckEnemyHit's type-6 dispatch by jmp
   3812  fca5							; (out of `beq` range). KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit.
   3813  fca5							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   3814  fca5							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   3815  fca5							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
