   4089  fdad							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   4090  fdad							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   4091  fdad							;   Hot rows overwrite with the TickCounter-bit5 pulse (amber/red).
   4092  fdad							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   4093  fdad							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   4094  fdad							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   4095  fdad							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4096  fdad							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4097  fdad							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   4098  fdad							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   4099  fdad							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   4100  fdad							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   4101  fdad							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   4102  fdad							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   4103  fdad							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   4104  fdad							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   4105  fdad							;   in S3.0b.
