   4407  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4408  fe9c							; TallyWork — level-bonus count-up (user spec 2026-10-02): reaching the miner
   4409  fe9c							; freezes the frame (dispatch bypasses input/physics/enemies via DropTarget
   4410  fe9c							; $FE), bank2 TallyEntry adds +50 every 4 frames and writes the coin tone
   4411  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   4412  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   4413  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
